  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training - Global Procurement Initiative: Life-Cycle Cost Analysis Curriculum Platform Maintenance and Supply Training, through Supply Chain Vision, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Life-Cycle Cost Analysis (LCCA) Curriculum Platform Maintenance and Supplemental Training Contract provides ongoing technical services including the continued hosting and maintenance of the LCCA web-based course developed under a previous contract as well as supplemental live-training support on LCCA. The LCCA web-based course is utilized to train public procurement practitioners on how to conduct life-cycle cost analyses in government procurements.</narrative>
  </description>
